sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Customer as User
    participant OrderSvc as Order Command API
    participant Outbox as Transactional Outbox
    participant CDC as Debezium CDC Engine
    participant Kafka as Kafka Event Broker
    participant Fulfillment as Shipping Worker

    Customer->>OrderSvc: POST /checkout
    OrderSvc->>OrderSvc: Validate Business Invariants
    OrderSvc->>Outbox: Insert Order + Outbox Record (Single ACID Tx)
    OrderSvc-->>Customer: 202 Accepted (Order ID: ord_8832)

    Note over Outbox,CDC: Asynchronous Event Relay
    CDC->>Outbox: Tail DB Write-Ahead Log
    CDC->>Kafka: Publish Event (Topic: orders.placed.v1)
    
    Kafka->>Fulfillment: Consume Event Stream
    Fulfillment->>Fulfillment: Allocate Warehouse Inventory
    Fulfillment->>Kafka: Publish Event (Topic: inventory.reserved.v1)
